Summary of Implemented Source Code
1. RAG Service (src/rag-service/)

Core Module (app/core/):
config.py - Pydantic settings with environment variables for all services
security.py - API key authentication and rate limiting

Services (app/services/):
llm_service.py - OpenAI integration for response generation with streaming support
document_processor.py - Document chunking with sentence boundary detection
cache_service.py - Redis caching for queries and embeddings
queue_service.py - RabbitMQ task publishing
vector_store.py - Qdrant vector storage (already existed)

Utils (app/utils/):
logger.py - Structured JSON logging
metrics.py - Prometheus metrics for monitoring

API (app/api/):
models.py - Pydantic request/response models
routes.py - FastAPI endpoints (/query, /ingest, /collections, etc.)

Main Application:
main.py - FastAPI app with lifespan management
Dockerfile - Multi-stage Docker build
requirements.txt - Updated dependencies

2. Document Ingestor (src/document-ingestor/)
file_parsers.py - Parsers for TXT, PDF, DOCX, HTML
ingestor.py - Document processing and chunking
queue_consumer.py - RabbitMQ consumer
storage.py - MinIO object storage client
main.py - Service entry point
Dockerfile - Container build

3. Queue Worker (src/rag-service/queue-worker/)
tasks.py - Task handlers for background processing
worker.py - RabbitMQ worker process
Dockerfile - Container build

4. Tests (src/rag-service/tests/)
test_api.py - API endpoint tests
test_services.py - Service unit tests
conftest.py - Pytest fixtures
Architecture Flow
Client Request → RAG Service API → Vector Store (Qdrant)
                      ↓                    ↓
                 Cache (Redis)        LLM Service (OpenAI)
                      ↓
              Queue (RabbitMQ) → Document Ingestor → MinIO Storage
